"text":"R3","words":[{"text":"R3","x":1098,"y":1352,"width":33,"height":24}]},{"text":"그림 3.47 • 송신자 4개, 유한 버퍼를 가진 라우터, 멀티홉 경로","words":[{"text":"그림","x":418,"y":1406,"width":56,"height":30},{"text":"3.47","x":486,"y":1408,"width":72,"height":29},{"text":"•","x":572,"y":1416,"width":16,"height":14},{"text":"송신자","x":601,"y":1409,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"4개,","x":697,"y":1410,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"유한","x":768,"y":1411,"width":59,"height":31},{"text":"버퍼를","x":838,"y":1411,"width":83,"height":32},{"text":"가진","x":932,"y":1411,"width":56,"height":32},{"text":"라우터,","x":1000,"y":1411,"width":93,"height":34},{"text":"멀티홉","x":1111,"y":1410,"width":84,"height":31},{"text":"경로","x":1206,"y":1410,"width":57,"height":31}]},{"text":"래의 데이터가 네트워크로 전송되고 목적지에 전달되괴 오버플로가 거의 발생하지 않","words":[{"text":"래의","x":509,"y":1555,"width":63,"height":40},{"text":"데이터가","x":589,"y":1557,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"네트워크로","x":739,"y":1558,"width":170,"height":39},{"text":"전송되고","x":924,"y":1559,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"목적지에","x":1073,"y":1557,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"전달되괴","x":1227,"y":1556,"width":148,"height":39},{"text":"오버플로가","x":1390,"y":1556,"width":180,"height":40},{"text":"거의","x":1585,"y":1556,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"발생하지","x":1670,"y":1556,"width":134,"height":40},{"text":"않","x":1821,"y":1560,"width":29,"height":40}]},{"text":"뜨므로, 해당되는 처리량은 약간 커진다. 그러므로 Arn이 작은 값일 때, Årn의 증가는","words":[{"text":"뜨므로,","x":506,"y":1622,"width":109,"height":37},{"text":"해당되는","x":634,"y":1621,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"처리량은","x":790,"y":1621,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"약간","x":943,"y":1622,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"커진다.","x":1029,"y":1620,"width":109,"height":40},{"text":"그러므로","x":1157,"y":1620,"width":141,"height":38},{"text":"Arn이","x":1315,"y":1619,"width":76,"height":43},{"text":"작은","x":1413,"y":1620,"width":72,"height":38},{"text":"값일","x":1503,"y":1620,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"때,","x":1593,"y":1620,"width":43,"height":39},{"text":"Årn의","x":1656,"y":1620,"width":78,"height":42},{"text":"증가는","x":1753,"y":1621,"width":97,"height":41}]},{"text":"Åout의 증가를 가져온다.","words":[{"text":"Åout의","x":506,"y":1684,"width":86,"height":42},{"text":"증가를","x":607,"y":1684,"width":103,"height":40},{"text":"가져온다.","x":723,"y":1684,"width":143,"height":40}]},{"text":"지금까지 극히 작은 트래픽의 경우를 살펴보았고, 이제 Arn값(따라서 시\u0027n)이 매우","words":[{"text":"지금까지","x":573,"y":1748,"width":130,"height":40},{"text":"극히","x":722,"y":1749,"width":64,"height":39},{"text":"작은","x":806,"y":1749,"width":68,"height":39},{"text":"트래픽의","x":889,"y":1749,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"경우를","x":1045,"y":1749,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"살펴보았고,","x":1163,"y":1747,"width":184,"height":41},{"text":"이제","x":1368,"y":1748,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"Arn값(따라서","x":1454,"y":1748,"width":201,"height":42},{"text":"시\u0027n)이","x":1677,"y":1749,"width":92,"height":42},{"text":"매우","x":1789,"y":1751,"width":62,"height":39}]},{"text":"큰 경우를 살펴보겠다. 라우터 R2를 고려해 보자. 라우터 R2에 도작하는 A—C 트래","words":[{"text":"큰","x":505,"y":1815,"width":33,"height":35},{"text":"경우를","x":555,"y":1812,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"살펴보겠다.","x":669,"y":1813,"width":176,"height":39},{"text":"라우터","x":865,"y":1813,"width":97,"height":40},{"text":"R2를","x":981,"y":1814,"width":81,"height":38},{"text":"고려해","x":1077,"y":1812,"width":101,"height":40},{"text":"보자.","x":1196,"y":1812,"width":77,"height":39},{"text":"라우터","x":1294,"y":1811,"width":102,"height":40},{"text":"R2에","x":1416,"y":1812,"width":82,"height":39},{"text":"도작하는","x":1516,"y":1812,"width":148,"height":40},{"text":"A—C","x":1679,"y":1817,"width":93,"height":30},{"text":"트래","x":1788,"y":1816,"width":60,"height":39}]},{"text":"퍽은 (RI에서 전달된 후 R2에 도착하는) R2에서 Arn값에 관계없이, RI에서 R2까지의","words":[{"text":"퍽은","x":507,"y":1876,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"(RI에서","x":583,"y":1877,"width":122,"height":40},{"text":"전달된","x":723,"y":1877,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"후","x":834,"y":1878,"width":35,"height":38},{"text":"R2에","x":881,"y":1877,"width":77,"height":39},{"text":"도착하는)","x":974,"y":1877,"width":149,"height":41},{"text":"R2에서","x":1138,"y":1876,"width":113,"height":39},{"text":"Arn값에","x":1268,"y":1875,"width":114,"height":43},{"text":"관계없이,","x":1398,"y":1876,"width":153,"height":40},{"text":"RI에서","x":1566,"y":1876,"width":120,"height":39},{"text":"R2까지의","x":1704,"y":1877,"width":145,"height":41}]},{"text":"링크 용량, R인 도착률을 가질 수 있다. 만약 Al\u0027n이 모든 연결(BA) 연결을 포함하는)","words":[{"text":"링크","x":508,"y":1940,"width":62,"height":39},{"text":"용량,","x":584,"y":1940,"width":74,"height":39},{"text":"R인","x":673,"y":1941,"width":59,"height":38},{"text":"도착률을","x":746,"y":1941,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"가질","x":895,"y":1941,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"수","x":976,"y":1942,"width":36,"height":39},{"text":"있다.","x":1028,"y":1941,"width":73,"height":40},{"text":"만약","x":1118,"y":1941,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"Al\u0027n이","x":1200,"y":1940,"width":77,"height":43},{"text":"모든","x":1295,"y":1942,"width":73,"height":36},{"text":"연결(BA)","x":1384,"y":1940,"width":177,"height":41},{"text":"연결을","x":1580,"y":1941,"width":109,"height":38},{"text":"포함하는)","x":1704,"y":1941,"width":147,"height":43}]},{"text":"에 대해 매우 크다면, R2의 B—D 트래픽 도착률은 A—C 트래픽 도착률보다 클 수 있","words":[{"text":"에","x":506,"y":2004,"width":29,"height":38},{"text":"대해","x":552,"y":2004,"width":62,"height":39},{"text":"매우","x":629,"y":2004,"width":67,"height":40},{"text":"크다면,","x":709,"y":2005,"width":107,"height":40},{"text":"R2의","x":831,"y":2005,"width":75,"height":40},{"text":"B—D","x":923,"y":2011,"width":88,"height":30},{"text":"트래픽","x":1026,"y":2006,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"도착률은","x":1142,"y":2005,"width":141,"height":39},{"text":"A—C","x":1295,"y":2009,"width":93,"height":30},{"text":"트래픽","x":1403,"y":2005,"width":104,"height":40},{"text":"도착률보다","x":1526,"y":2005,"width":186,"height":40},{"text":"클","x":1726,"y":2007,"width":36,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":1775,"y":2006,"width":34,"height":39},{"text":"있","x":1824,"y":2007,"width":27,"height":38}]},{"text":"다. A—C와 B—D 트래픽은 버퍼 공간을 R2 라우터에서 경쟁해야 하므로, R2를 성공","words":[{"text":"다.","x":507,"y":2068,"width":38,"height":39},{"text":"A—C와","x":560,"y":2069,"width":121,"height":39},{"text":"B—D","x":692,"y":2075,"width":85,"height":29},{"text":"트래픽은","x":791,"y":2069,"width":136,"height":40},{"text":"버퍼","x":942,"y":2071,"width":62,"height":39},{"text":"공간을","x":1022,"y":2070,"width":104,"height":40},{"text":"R2","x":1138,"y":2075,"width":45,"height":30},{"text":"라우터에서","x":1201,"y":2069,"width":172,"height":40},{"text":"경쟁해야","x":1393,"y":2069,"width":145,"height":40},{"text":"하므로,","x":1552,"y":2070,"width":119,"height":39},{"text":"R2를","x":1688,"y":2071,"width":86,"height":37},{"text":"성공","x":1790,"y":2070,"width":62,"height":39}]},{"text":"적으로 통과하는 트래픽의 양은 B—D에서 제공된 부하가 크면 클수록 더 작아","words":[{"text":"적으로","x":508,"y":2132,"width":96,"height":39},{"text":"통과하는","x":617,"y":2134,"width":134,"height":39},{"text":"트래픽의","x":864,"y":2134,"width":133,"height":40},{"text":"양은","x":1017,"y":2135,"width":67,"height":40},{"text":"B—D에서","x":1098,"y":2134,"width":156,"height":40},{"text":"제공된","x":1274,"y":2134,"width":105,"height":39},{"text":"부하가","x":1395,"y":2134,"width":111,"height":41},{"text":"크면","x":1520,"y":2135,"width":72,"height":38},{"text":"클수록","x":1609,"y":2134,"width":113,"height":40},{"text":"더","x":1739,"y":2134,"width":29,"height":40},{"text":"작아","x":1788,"y":2134,"width":65,"height":40}]},{"text":"진다. 극한적인 경우에 제공된 부하가 무한대에 가까워짐에 따라, R2의 빈 버퍼는 즉","words":[{"text":"진다.","x":508,"y":2197,"width":70,"height":40},{"text":"극한적인","x":594,"y":2198,"width":131,"height":39},{"text":"경우에","x":743,"y":2198,"width":95,"height":39},{"text":"제공된","x":856,"y":2198,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"부하가","x":972,"y":2199,"width":105,"height":40},{"text":"무한대에","x":1090,"y":2198,"width":137,"height":40},{"text":"가까워짐에","x":1246,"y":2198,"width":176,"height":40},{"text":"따라,","x":1441,"y":2199,"width":81,"height":39},{"text":"R2의","x":1540,"y":2199,"width":84,"height":39},{"text":"빈","x":1647,"y":2199,"width":32,"height":38},{"text":"버퍼는","x":1701,"y":2199,"width":107,"height":40},{"text":"즉","x":1825,"y":2201,"width":24,"height":37}]},{"text":"시 패킷으로 채워진다. 그리고 R2에서 A—C 연결의 처리량은 0이 된다. 이것은","words":[{"text":"시","x":508,"y":2261,"width":27,"height":40},{"text":"패킷으로","x":648,"y":2262,"width":131,"height":39},{"text":"채워진다.","x":793,"y":2261,"width":140,"height":40},{"text":"그리고","x":948,"y":2263,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"R2에서","x":1063,"y":2262,"width":111,"height":40},{"text":"A—C","x":1191,"y":2267,"width":90,"height":31},{"text":"연결의","x":1298,"y":2262,"width":103,"height":40},{"text":"처리량은","x":1419,"y":2262,"width":146,"height":40},{"text":"0이","x":1577,"y":2263,"width":56,"height":39},{"text":"된다.","x":1651,"y":2263,"width":84,"height":40},{"text":"이것은","x":1753,"y":2263,"width":100,"height":40}]},{"text":"트래픽이 많은 경우 A\u003c 종단간 처리율이 0이 된다는 것을 의미한다. 이 고찰은 그림","words":[{"text":"트래픽이","x":507,"y":2325,"width":126,"height":40},{"text":"많은","x":653,"y":2326,"width":65,"height":40},{"text":"경우","x":736,"y":2326,"width":63,"height":40},{"text":"A\u003c","x":812,"y":2331,"width":87,"height":30},{"text":"종단간","x":913,"y":2328,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"처리율이","x":1024,"y":2328,"width":126,"height":36},{"text":"0이","x":1167,"y":2329,"width":51,"height":35},{"text":"된다는","x":1236,"y":2328,"width":100,"height":36},{"text":"것을","x":1352,"y":2328,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"의미한다.","x":1436,"y":2328,"width":144,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":1603,"y":2327,"width":31,"height":40},{"text":"고찰은","x":1657,"y":2328,"width":113,"height":38},{"text":"그림","x":1787,"y":2328,"width":61,"height":38}]},{"text":"3.48에서 보이는 것처럼, 제공된 부하와 처리랑 간의 트레이드오프(trad㈗ff)가 발생함","words":[{"text":"3.48에서","x":507,"y":2390,"width":126,"height":40},{"text":"보이는","x":649,"y":2391,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"것처럼,","x":762,"y":2390,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"제공된","x